opencl: Bridge the rest of the OpenCL 2.0 SVM functions.

clSetKernelArgSVMPointer, clEnqueueSVMMemcpy, clEnqueueSVMMemFill,
clEnqueueSVMMap, clEnqueueSVMUnmap and clEnqueueSVMMigrateMem join
clSVMAlloc and clSVMFree, which this set already bridges. SVM pointers
are in the address space Wine shares with the host, so they cross the
bridge unchanged. Slots appended as for the 2.x functions.

From the Affinity-Wine-Builder 11.18 set (its 0068), without its own
clSVMAlloc and clSVMFree, which match the ones already here.
